    "description": {
      "value": "These wicked-looking spiked metal wheels fit around the ankles and jingle when the wearer walks, imposing a –1 item penalty on Stealth checks. If used as a weapon, they are treated as a spiked gauntlet.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n- **Requirements:** You are riding a mount\n\nYou kick both spurs into your mount's flank. Your mount takes 2d6 persistent bleed damage and gains the quickened condition for 1 minute or until the persistent bleed damage ends, whichever comes first. It can use the extra action only to Stride."
